flowchart TB
 UI[CAD Editor] --> MENUS[Menus / Tools]
 MENUS --> CM[Command Manager]
 CM --> DOC[Document Model]
 DOC --> GEOM[Geometry Kernel]
 DOC --> PLANES[Plane Manager]
 DOC --> RENDER[Three.js Renderer]
 DOC --> LOCAL[Local JSON Store]
 CM --> SCRIPT[TCS / Lua Host]
 SCRIPT --> CADAPI[Restricted CAD API]
 UI --> REST[Express API]
 REST --> AUTH[Authentication / Authorization]
 AUTH --> DB[(MySQL)]
 REST --> REV[Revision Service]